      "role": "user",
      "content": "ok i get the administrative part. but it still feels a bit uneasy knowing this person or company just sits on a huge pile of cash while we wait. is there any specific way they handle the security of it? like how do they make sure the money doesn't just... disappear or get mishandled while it's in their custody?",
